  "notes": "Herdr fork preview (wwelder/herdr): answer a choices-only card in your own words; the APM adds other machines' reports\n\nSource: 5e7ee12a642db106d7afb48b29d2ae2c4467e507.\n\n- `feed.act` takes text alone on any card that asks something, not only on a card with `input`. A card from `herdr feed ask` tells the asking agent `none of the choices you offered. They wrote: \"<text>\"`. A card a script polls gets a reply file with `\"action\": null` and the text. A card answered by an `on-reply` handler still takes text only when it has `input`.\n- The APM this host pushes to the Live Activity and the widgets adds what other machines report to it: every file under `live-activity/remote/<name>` in herdr's config directory that is younger than 150 s. A machine reports by writing the output of `herdr fleet-apm \"$HOME\"` to that file over ssh, once a minute. Counts and the headline are still this host's own.\n\nAll five assets were built by the manual Build artifacts workflow (run 44795973086).\n\nUpdate with `herdr update` on the preview channel.",
